<Panels>
  <config><![CDATA[{
  "game_id": 73,
  "created_at": "2026-05-06T02:30:00.000Z",
  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 1,
  "properties": {
    "panels": [
      {
        "key": "agathaweb-intro-css-efc51e36-f3fc-4a20-9569-cac5e8b06938",
        "text": "We've built the basic frame of Fayea's website with HTML. But right now, it looks a little plain, like a house with just its wooden skeleton.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/9e98a654152e8c81743eb5b7395e9a08-agathaweb-intro-css-panel-1-de6e26b8-249c-474f-94b2-bf8bbcffd900.png",
        "layout": "text-top-left"
      },
      {
        "key": "agathaweb-intro-css-c1ffd0a9-938b-4840-9b4f-d5bf59ded806",
        "text": "This is where CSS comes in! CSS, or Cascading Style Sheets, is like the paint, wallpaper, and decorations for our website house.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/5b2144d10151b6453795d0b51621e46f-agathaweb-intro-css-panel-2-04214a89-3b72-40c7-88a9-be3ee57ecc85.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "agathaweb-intro-css-d898fc7a-c0fa-4f3d-b428-343c8cde47e2",
        "text": "With CSS, we can easily change things like the color of Fayea's \"Welcome\" message. Imagine painting a wall in her dojo a bright, inviting color!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/2e9b9b2dd0d1f46d3306fa7cc8c9a621-agathaweb-intro-css-panel-3-4b088014-412e-4c11-8426-8f340f5370cb.png",
        "layout": "text-top-right"
      },
      {
        "key": "agathaweb-intro-css-c73a5079-38e1-4e13-982b-ad7ca0bcfbb3",
        "text": "We can also use CSS to change the background color of her entire website, or add a colorful pattern to make it feel more like her lively dojo!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/86ff118a58dfd993a5ee46290aa651f3-agathaweb-intro-css-panel-4-93cacd84-edaa-484a-aa3e-278df1be7083.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-left"
      },
      {
        "key": "agathaweb-intro-css-cc529a8d-3188-4742-bb7c-5347bc0455aa",
        "text": "So, HTML gives our website its sturdy structure, and CSS makes it beautiful and unique! Together, they bring Fayea's amazing Dojo to life online.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/0f183863f6588ba13dfa0d39318b8206-agathaweb-intro-css-panel-5-3fedc5ed-4432-4a10-8825-2b98b2383acf.png",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      }
    ],
    "generate_prompt": "Explain what CSS is and how it's used to make websites look good, comparing it to 'clothes' or 'paint' for the house. Show simple examples of CSS changing text color or background color to make Fayea's site more colorful."
  },
  "published": true,
  "audit_log": "[{\"changed_at\":\"2026-05-06 02:30:36 +0000\",\"changed\":[],\"changed_by_id\":1,\"changed_by_email\":\"brendan+levelbuilder@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-05-06 02:30:36 +0000\",\"changed\":[],\"changed_by_id\":1,\"changed_by_email\":\"brendan+levelbuilder@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-05-06 03:20:08 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"panels\"],\"changed_by_id\":1,\"changed_by_email\":\"brendan+levelbuilder@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-05-06 03:31:11 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"panels\"],\"changed_by_id\":1,\"changed_by_email\":\"brendan+levelbuilder@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-05-09 00:05:51 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"panels\"],\"changed_by_id\":1,\"changed_by_email\":\"brendan+levelbuilder@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-05-09 00:05:52 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"generate_prompt\"],\"changed_by_id\":1,\"changed_by_email\":\"brendan+levelbuilder@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-05-09 00:11:40 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"panels\"],\"changed_by_id\":1,\"changed_by_email\":\"brendan+levelbuilder@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-05-09 00:11:40 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"generate_prompt\"],\"changed_by_id\":1,\"changed_by_email\":\"brendan+levelbuilder@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-05-09 00:17:46 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"panels\"],\"changed_by_id\":1,\"changed_by_email\":\"brendan+levelbuilder@code.org\"}]"
